The Office of Ordinary Things. Graphic design studio in San Francisco.

They print with algae-based black ink from [[Living Ink]] and let the materials show. A lighter paper stock is a little see-through, and they leave it that way.

Work for Patagonia and Conservation International.

See [[Fresh Press]], [[Truth to Materials]]
